<title>NETHERLANDS: Goudsmit Q1 net up 22 pct to Dfl 2.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Goudsmit Q1 net up 22 pct to Dfl 2.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ZEIST, Netherlands 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.39 vs   2.09</p>
<p>    Net profit			     2.80 vs   2.30</p>
<p>    Turnover				41.00 vs  22.40</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     3.95 vs   2.49</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     0.20 vs   0.15</p>
<p>    Tax					0.80 vs   0.04</p>
<p>NOTE - Retail and services group Goudsmit N.V. said it maintained the expectation that profit over 1997 will be above that of 1996, including 1997 acquisitions and the consolidation of Edes Seagull bought last year.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
